{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38872","headline":"投长沙裴侍郎 · 杜荀鹤","name":"投长沙裴侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此身虽贱道长存，非谒朱门谒孔门。\n秪望至公将卷读，不求朝士致书论。\n垂纶雨结渔乡思，吹木风传鴈夜魂。\n男子受恩须有地，平生不受等闲恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38872.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38872","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}